1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,482
Collagen cream does not replace

2
00:00:01,502 --> 00:00:03,476
your collagen. Collagen powder does

3
00:00:03,496 --> 00:00:05,221
not travel straight to your face.

4
00:00:05,271 --> 00:00:07,595
So where does it go?

5
00:00:07,595 --> 00:00:10,249
Across 23 trials, it appears to help.

6
00:00:10,249 --> 00:00:12,181
Remove the industry funded studies,

7
00:00:12,181 --> 00:00:13,976
and the answer changes.

8
00:00:14,026 --> 00:00:16,263
Think of your skin as a building.

9
00:00:16,263 --> 00:00:18,870
Collagen is the main structure inside it.

10
00:00:18,870 --> 00:00:21,153
It keeps everything firm and upright.

11
00:00:21,173 --> 00:00:23,756
As we age, collagen production slows.

12
00:00:23,830 --> 00:00:27,255
And ultraviolet light switches on
enzymes that cut collagen apart.

13
00:00:27,255 --> 00:00:29,504
The sun runs a demolition crew.

14
00:00:29,524 --> 00:00:30,681
It works weekends.

15
00:00:30,701 --> 00:00:32,708
Sunscreen is not just about sunburn.

16
00:00:32,708 --> 00:00:35,906
It draws a boundary around the building.

17
00:00:35,926 --> 00:00:39,253
Preserving collagen is usually
easier than replacing it later.

18
00:00:39,303 --> 00:00:40,775
Now, the cream.

19
00:00:40,795 --> 00:00:44,036
To pass through skin, a molecule
generally needs to be under

20
00:00:44,036 --> 00:00:45,734
500 daltons.

21
00:00:45,754 --> 00:00:48,281
Collagen is around 300,000.

22
00:00:48,281 --> 00:00:50,782
It is not getting through that door.

23
00:00:50,802 --> 00:00:54,032
It may still form a moisturising
film on the surface.

24
00:00:54,032 --> 00:00:55,976
Skin may feel smoother.

25
00:00:55,996 --> 00:00:59,093
But polishing the windows
is not replacing the beams.

26
00:00:59,143 --> 00:01:00,362
Now, the powder.

27
00:01:00,382 --> 00:01:05,696
Swallow collagen, and digestion breaks
it into peptides and amino acids.

28
00:01:05,696 --> 00:01:08,326
Your stomach does not
offer facial delivery.

29
00:01:08,346 --> 00:01:10,820
But your body decides where they go,

30
00:01:11,110 --> 00:01:14,714
to skin, joints, tendons, or
wherever repairs are most urgent.

31
00:01:14,783 --> 00:01:16,318
Your face ordered scaffolding.

32
00:01:16,338 --> 00:01:17,924
It got spare parts instead.

33
00:01:17,944 --> 00:01:20,305
Trials do point to a modest benefit.

34
00:01:20,555 --> 00:01:24,260
Does the powder work? Trials do report
modest improvements in hydration,

35
00:01:24,280 --> 00:01:26,116
elasticity, or wrinkles.

36
00:01:26,136 --> 00:01:27,793
But many were small, short,

37
00:01:27,793 --> 00:01:29,564
and industry funded.

38
00:01:29,584 --> 00:01:33,700
In 2025, researchers pooled
23 randomised trials.

39
00:01:33,700 --> 00:01:35,226
All together, a benefit.

40
00:01:35,226 --> 00:01:37,646
Keep only the studies
without industry funding,

41
00:01:37,646 --> 00:01:43,872
and it is no longer
statistically significant.

42
00:01:43,892 --> 00:01:46,432
Keep only the higher quality studies.

43
00:01:46,452 --> 00:01:49,589
Same result. The effect stops showing up.

44
00:01:49,609 --> 00:01:51,216
Do supplements definitely work?

45
00:01:51,216 --> 00:01:52,655
We cannot say that.

46
00:01:52,675 --> 00:01:55,516
Definitely fail? We cannot
confidently say that either.

47
00:01:55,516 --> 00:01:57,694
The independent evidence is uncertain.

48
00:01:57,944 --> 00:01:59,821
What the evidence actually supports.

49
00:01:59,841 --> 00:02:01,120
Broad spectrum sunscreen,

50
00:02:01,140 --> 00:02:02,371
every day. Not smoking.

51
00:02:02,371 --> 00:02:04,410
Enough protein and vitamin C.

52
00:02:04,410 --> 00:02:08,903
And for suitable users, topical retinoids
have considerably stronger evidence for

53
00:02:08,903 --> 00:02:11,531
encouraging collagen
production than collagen cream.

54
00:02:11,551 --> 00:02:13,803
Collagen cream can be
a pleasant moisturiser.

55
00:02:13,803 --> 00:02:14,803
Collagen powder is

56
00:02:14,823 --> 00:02:18,772
optional. Protect the building before
you buy expensive powdered bricks.
